      <mxCell id="i_note" value="Each component declares: allowed_roles · program_code · requires{subject,verb,granularity,sensitivity} · scopes[geography,program] · data{source,view,scope_columns}.&#10;The resolver drops a component from the manifest if the user's role isn't allowed, the programme code doesn't match, or OPA denies. Empty sections collapse.&#10;A second OPA check fires at /api/component/{id}/data so a tampered front-end can't fetch what wasn't rendered." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF9C3;strokeColor=#CA8A04;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="700" width="1500" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    </root>
  </mxGraphModel>
</diagram>
